      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "BLUF — EXECUTIVE SUMMARY",
      "lane": "BOOKEND",
      "narration_text": "The framing that sticks wrong is that this is just a download tool. It's not. It's a provenance pipeline: CC0-only by design, an upscale step through Topaz Photo AI when that tool is present, and a source sidecar — SI object id, credit, license, URL — written automatically next to every image. You don't track attribution; the script does it for you.",
