      "act": "WORKED EXAMPLE — TEXT SEARCH",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Here is a text search. The script tokenizes your query — dropping stop words, short words, and domain noise like smithsonian, collection, national — then scores every record in the local index. Candidates display with their SI unit, object type, and thumbnail URL. You pick a number, or pass --yes to auto-accept the top hit.",
